sapi (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of sapi:
    - SaltStack salt-api (netapi) hybrid CLI client (shortcut & structured modes).
    - Multi-profile configuration, secret resolution, and 0600 token cache.
    - Full-Access MCP stdio server with 12 Salt tools.
    - Manual pages (sapi(1) and sapi-*(1)) and shell completions (bash/zsh/fish).

